From adc741a1fc5f607a2eac18bdf52c22561c1f785b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claude <claude@example.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 17:36:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] C1/C2: authored step notes and prediction prompts on the
 reference trace

- CodingProblem.trace_notes / trace_predictions (migration 0008), validated in clean()
- trace_annotations payload only for the pinned example; baked via json_script
- tutor-view.js renders notes/cards with textContent; reveal state in localStorage
- check_problem_traces warns about dead notes / unpinned annotations
- tests: payload, validation, rendering, escaping, checker; e2e for the viewer
